@baseUrl = http://localhost:4004

### 1. Check CAP server metadata
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/project-srv/$metadata

### 2. Get all projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/project-srv/Projects

### 3. Get all employees
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/employee-srv/Employees

### 4. Get all clients
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/client-srv/Clients

### 5. Get all tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/task-srv/Tasks

### 6. Get all budgets
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/budget-srv/Budgets

### 7. Get all milestones
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/milestone-srv/Milestones

### 8. Get all timesheets
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/timesheet-srv/Timesheets

### 9. Get all timesheet entries
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/timesheet-entry-srv/TimesheetEntries

### 10. Get all invoices
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/invoice-srv/Invoices

### 11. Get all alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/alert-srv/Alerts

### 12. Get timesheets awaiting approval
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/approval-srv/Timesheets?$filter=status eq 'SUBMITTED'

### 15. Submit the timesheet
POST {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/timesheet-srv/submitTimesheet
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "timesheetID": "50000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003"
}

### Check timesheet status
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/timesheet-srv/Timesheets

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/approval-srv/approveTimesheet

###
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/employee-srv/Employees

